            "review_title": "Review at Oaksip Whisky & Cocktails Bar",
            "review_text": "la_viajera_constanta\nBrussels, Belgium2933 contributions\n1\nExcellent cocktails in classy bar!\nDec 2025 • Couples\nWe were heading somewhere else when we stumbled across Oaksip and decided to investigate, and we're very happy that we did!\n\nThe bar is semi-hidden up a flight of stairs and is small, intimate and classy. It is indoor but there is a small outside space for smoking. They only serve cocktails and spirits/liqueur (no beer or wine) but wow, what a great selection they have!\n\nWe were there over Christmas time so we chose two \"Navid Mules\" from the seasonal speciality menu. They were fantastic, beautifully crafted and presented, and absolutely delicious. In fact they were so good we had to have a second one! They also have some light snack options such as crackers and dip.\n\nService was impeccable and the bar staff are clearly highly skilled cocktail makers. Definitely worth a visit to sample one or two!\nRead more\nWritten January 18, 2026\nOAKSIP Whisky & Cocktails Bar\nThank you very much for your thoughtful and detailed review. \nWe’re delighted that you decided to step in and that OAKSIP turned out to be a happy discovery. \nIt’s wonderful to hear that you enjoyed the intimate atmosphere, our spirits-focused concept, and the seasonal cocktails—having a second round is the best compliment we could ask for. We’re also grateful for your kind words about our service and the craftsmanship of our team. \n\nThank you for taking the time to share your experience, and we truly hope to welcome you back again soon.\nRead more\nWritten February 7, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
