            "review_title": "Review at Oaksip Whisky & Cocktails Bar",
            "review_text": "Benji H\nBelfast, United Kingdom132 contributions\n1\nHigh quality cocktail bar\nJan 2026 • Couples\nThe best cocktail bar we have ever been too.\n\n10/10 for service, atmosphere and quality. \n\nThis classy speakeasy is tucked away down an alley but is beautiful on the inside. \n\nWe stopped in on a cloudy day and were treated to amazing service and the highest quality cocktails we have ever encountered. \n\nIf you like cocktails this is the place to go.\nRead more\nWritten January 12, 2026\nOAKSIP Whisky & Cocktails Bar\nThank you very much for such an incredible review. We’re truly honored to hear that OAKSIP stands out as the best cocktail bar you’ve ever visited. \nYour kind words about our service, atmosphere, and cocktail quality mean a great deal to us. \nWe’re delighted that you found us tucked away yet welcoming, and that your visit—cloudy day included—was made special by our team and drinks. \nWe sincerely appreciate your recommendation and look forward to welcoming you back again.\nRead more\nWritten February 7, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
