            "review_text": "KMG4YL3\nLondon, United Kingdom41 contributions\n1\nVery impressive!\nNov 2025 • Friends\nA very special find, hidden along an alleyway in District 1. Oaksip came up after a search for a cocktail bar. After a few nights sampling roof bars around the centre of Ho Chi Minh, of variable quality, this bar was a revelation. A fabulous and well curated selection of single malts, plus delicious cocktails. Oaksip was the highlight of my trip. Highly recommended!\nRead more\nWritten November 28, 2025\nOAKSIP Whisky & Cocktails Bar\nThank you very much for your thoughtful and generous review. We’re truly honored that you found OAKSIP while exploring District 1 and that it stood out after visiting other bars around the city. It’s wonderful to hear that our selection of single malts and cocktails became a highlight of your trip. Your recommendation means a great deal to us, and we sincerely hope to welcome you back on your next visit to Ho Chi Minh City.\nRead more\nWritten December 13, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
