            "review_text": "Allan B\nAuckland, New Zealand398 contributions\n1\nBrilliant!\nAug 2025 • Couples\nBrilliant little higher end bar with cracking drinks and knowledgeable servers. We tried all sorts of various Vietnamese gins, Japanese Shochu’s and whiskey, American bourbon and cocktails and loved them all.\nWritten August 17, 2025\nOAKSIP Whisky & Cocktails Bar\nThank you very much for your kind and detailed review. We are truly delighted to hear that you enjoyed exploring our selection of Vietnamese gins, Japanese shochu, whiskey, bourbon, and cocktails. Our team takes pride in curating and serving a diverse range of drinks, and your recognition of their knowledge means a great deal to us. We sincerely look forward to welcoming you back for another refined experience.\nRead more\nWritten September 30, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
