            "review_text": "Lesley C\nLondon, United Kingdom63 contributions\n1\nGreat bar professional barman\nJan 2025 • Couples\nWhat a great little bar that we found by accident up an alleyway then up some stairs, it played great music but the staff were so professional in how they made the drinks it was like watching a show, we would absolutely recommend anyone to go and find this place it was amazing\nValue\nService\nAtmosphere\nWritten February 5, 2025\nOAKSIP\nThank you so much for your wonderful review! We're thrilled that you stumbled upon our bar and had such a great experience. Our team takes pride in crafting cocktails with precision and passion, so it’s fantastic to hear that you enjoyed the show! We truly appreciate your recommendation and hope to welcome you back for another amazing night soon.\nRead more\nWritten February 20, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
